<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel 1997 Q1 sales fall.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel 1997 Q1 sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					   697    vs	802</p>
<p>NOTE - Eurotunnel SA /Plc published its sales figures in the official bulletin BALO. It said the sales figures, recalculated using an exchange rate at March 31, 1997, of 9.24 francs to the pound, totalled 883 million francs.</p>
<p>The turnover figures for the period do not include insurance payments of 267 million francs received following a November 18 fire which severely disrupted service.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
